<para>Hard cap on the TT-rank at every bond. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>0 = no cap (rank determined solely by <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1storage_1_1_tensor_train_config_1a908fb8d82ec6eba55c0dcba24873ecac" kindref="member">eps</ref></computeroutput>). Non-zero values override the SVD-based truncation when it would produce a higher rank, trading accuracy for memory. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
